							<td id="article_title" colspan="2"><a href="http://www.hdtvmagazine.com/articles/2009/12/the-end-of-high-definition-broadcasting.php">The End of High Definition Broadcasting</a></td>
						</tr><tr>
							<td id="article_byline">
								by <b>Rodolfo La Maestra</b> on <b>December  8, 2009</b>
							</td><td id="article_category">
								Categories: <b><a href="/category.php?id=288&category=Broadcast">Broadcast</a></b>, <b><a href="/category.php?id=328&category=Digital (DTV) Transition">Digital (DTV) Transition</a></b>, <b><a href="/category.php?id=364&category=Mobile HDTV">Mobile HDTV</a></b>, <b><a href="/category.php?id=4&category=Politics & Policy">Politics & Policy</a></b>
